      "text": "9. The Respondent Authority is directed to complete the transfer formalities in\nrespect of Plot No. 2, Sector Ecotech-IV, Greater Noida in favour of the\nRevisionist without insisting upon payment of the construction/functional delay\nand time-extension charges set aside by this order. The Respondent Authority\nshall undertake a fresh reconciliation of the account, give due credit for the\namount of ₹3,13,90,201/- lying towards excess premium, to the extent\napplicable, and communicate to the Revisionist, by a reasoned statement of\naccount, any lawful post-acquisition dues, if remaining. The revision petition is\naccordingly disposed of in the above terms.",
      "html": null
    },
